 "_readme": [
  "ACMG secondary findings list v3.3 (Lee et al., Genet Med 2025;27(8):101454, doi:10.1016/j.gim.2025.101454): the 81 genes of v3.2 as listed on https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/clinvar/docs/acmg/ (gene set cross-checked 18 Oct 2026, exact match) plus ABCD1, CYP27A1 and PLN added in v3.3.",
  "inheritance is the gene-level mode used by the engine. It was curated by the spec author from the ACMG SF tables and OMIM; goal G024 requires a human to check every row against the published v3.3 table before the eval labels are written. Any doubt: set review_always true (safe direction).",
  "review_always true means relatives are never auto-pruned or auto-notified for this gene: they go to NEEDS_REVIEW. Carriers are still notified through their owner.",
  "kb_scope false keeps the gene out of the loaded ClinVar graph to bound memory (TTN alone has 40,949 alleles and 97,618 submissions in gene_specific_summary.txt of 11 Oct 2026). The 83 in-scope genes have about 306,700 alleles and 778,900 submissions.",
  "KB_SCOPE=core loads only genes with core=true (fallback if the FalkorDB service runs short of memory)."
 ],
